<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Addition, subtraction, and scalar multiplication of 2x2 matrices</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Given the matrices</p>
<p>\[A = {@mat1@} \quad \text{and} \quad B = {@mat2@},\]</p>
<p>find \(A + B\), \(A - B\), \(B - A\), and \(2A\). Enter exact integers in each cell.</p>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
  <li><div>\(A + B = \) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div></li>
  <li><div>\(A - B = \) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div></li>
  <li><div>\(B - A = \) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div></li>
  <li><div>\(2A = \) [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]]</div></li>
</ol>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><b>Worked Solution:</b></p>
<p>Given the \(2 \times 2\) matrices \(A = {@mat1@}\) and \(B = {@mat2@}\), perform matrix addition, subtraction, and scalar multiplication entry by entry:</p>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
  <li>
    \[A + B = {@mat1@} + {@mat2@} = {@sum_tex@} = \boxed{{@ta1@}}\]
  </li>
  <li>
    \[A - B = {@mat1@} - {@mat2@} = {@sub1_tex@} = \boxed{{@ta2@}}\]
  </li>
  <li>
    \[B - A = {@mat2@} - {@mat1@} = {@sub2_tex@} = \boxed{{@ta3@}}\]
  </li>
  <li>
    \[2A = 2{@mat1@} = {@mul_tex@} = \boxed{{@ta4@}}\]
  </li>
</ol>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
